{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8dfdb9e3598a95ea4853d45775894535b0a485e0e672943281c24048454a7a0", "ja": "（可憐から、『衣装の試着が終わったからきてほしい』\nと連絡があった……）", "zh": "（可怜联系我，说试衣已经结束了，希望我过去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "3e4d4375ef6f51689471e91da3ca8279ba6595f8109c2e326546f686e6cb948d", "ja": "ふふっ……全体的にスマートで……けど、\nスカートは軽やかで……ふふっ、かわいいな……。", "zh": "呵呵……整体看起来很利落……不过，裙子轻盈飘逸……呵呵，好可爱啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "77b8037facdd37fdf71f0cebdd34303c04bb8b504bd7b7e22d86e6bc87b59c67", "ja": "お疲れ様、可憐。\nその様子だと気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n看你的样子，似乎很喜欢啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "861f1b74a8a45cd91e90117aff204c29f2a03327b032c38691c52c1d6e4b114d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……！\nはい……！　素敵な衣装をありがとうございます……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……！\n嗯……！谢谢您送我这么漂亮的服装……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "755e4b5f2eb1d16b288663feae60b5ae7ab3e42c6b232cd18307e2d48ed2d26a", "ja": "あ、あの……。私……この衣装を見て、思ったんです。\nなんだか、香水みたいな衣装だって。", "zh": "啊、那个……我……看到这套服装时，就想到了。\n总觉得，这是一套像香水一样的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d5aba03655f768639211b8b7e5c8e2dd2bef8df6dfe0624cb4333c69af0e8be4", "ja": "香水？", "zh": "香水？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "e846792f7b492f1cf10b3dfa3c006aeb513541c05a9f532346cc6f0f8184391c", "ja": "は、はい……。衣装のシルエットが、香水の瓶みたいに\n……しっかりとしていて、でも魅力もあって……。", "zh": "是、是的……服装的轮廓就像香水瓶一样……\n……很有型，同时又很有魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "3d557f8dac2fc2778842a747cda435041fd9ba7ef36ef140464521ed0ca8a79e", "ja": "スカートは、動くとひらひら揺れるんです……。\n揺れる度に……香りを振りまいてるようにみえて……。", "zh": "裙子动起来就会轻轻飘荡……  \n每次飘动……看起来就像在散发香气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "84f326cb6e986dd5e2b7457addb5610ef5740afd7e29177e1e801223debca8d7", "ja": "そう言われると、確かに……。\nなんだかいい香りがしてきそうだな。", "zh": "你这么一说，确实……  \n感觉好像都能闻到香味了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "cd9c30724452788b018d5a0030788c7d1b625a62255a7eca5fad6b34ee9f5e7c", "ja": "えへへ……♪　あ、あと色もそうです……。少しずつ\nグラデーションしているところ、なんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪啊，还有颜色也是……。像这样一点一点渐变的地方……就是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "e073c751da0b75f57ae29db9faefdac6bf220196c2258506a786717b737506d8", "ja": "香水の香りも、時間とともに変化するから……。\nい、色で表現したら、こんな感じなのかなって……。", "zh": "因为香水的香味也会随着时间发生变化……\n要、要是用颜色来表现的话，我觉得大概就是这种感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "089b41041428b099ea882213189445cd7d1f7001ed5cd604f561611e9f3a3f21", "ja": "なるほどな……。\n可憐ならではの着眼点で、俺も勉強になったよ。", "zh": "原来如此……\n这是可怜独有的观察角度，我也学到了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "0f9db1e07403792f89831fbe3df8bfd0aa74524ad2590208fb06ba1cc309bf0b", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？　でも……この衣装の素敵な\nところは、もっとあるんですけど……あっ。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？可是……这套服装还有更多精彩之处……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "d8361879cc2b1fbb0baa08edce9a97154a77fb3b663df0eb71c1f7a1afb8ecf6", "ja": "わ、私……一方的に喋ってますね……。\nううっ、すみません……。", "zh": "我、我……一直在自说自话呢……  \n呜呜，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "f3eb88806f8b8bb926761f871a2016b30d66b7915ae45494066025e7f4054242", "ja": "{$P$}さんに……伝えなきゃって\n思ったら……気持ちだけ、先走ってしまって……。", "zh": "只要一想到……必须向{$P$}先生传达……\n情绪就、一个人自顾自地激动起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "094a89b16c9cc2124be484d72dd3d2bb9002da694f5d7e6a5bce97440640ecd8", "ja": "ははっ、気にしなくていいよ。夢中になるくらい\n可憐が喜んでくれたってわかったからな。", "zh": "哈哈，不用在意。知道可怜开心得都入迷了，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "87610b57abb92d408d59d849d92d49b71d8d503bd9d6b6256ea8b1874808fcca", "ja": "はい……！　私、とっても嬉しくて……\nだから、その……あ、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "是……！我真的特别高兴……\n所以，那个……谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c07a76145d4a7f86d4ed9fd94091a4eb0636620879f328c477870f0f2aa5c892", "ja": "こっちこそ、ありがとな。\nあ、そうだ！　可憐にひとつ頼みがあるんだ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。\n啊，对了！我有件事想拜托可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "d209971ba98f138f79c50803496a3da04fd0ac5d9e6e14271ff2e1eb76a15f60", "ja": "わ、私に……ですか？", "zh": "是、是要我……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a5d1eccb7c25ad5d1f6f687003bb00cbb16516dbf71bb9cbca4e0b65a9817b93", "ja": "ああ。可憐じゃないとできないことだよ。\nその衣装に合った香水を選んでくれないか？", "zh": "嗯。这是只有可怜才能做到的事。\n你能帮忙选一款适合那套服装的香水吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1020_p", "source_sha256": "53d54e943efb464cc15c05f1438369f03e187582d504071d54d7aa55d8d70427", "ja": "さっき可憐の感想を聞いて、思いついてね。\nステージで香りがしたら、可憐も心強いだろうなって。", "zh": "刚才听了可怜的感想，我就想到了。\n要是舞台上能散发香味，可怜应该也会更有底气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "ee0807813f0be334079b1431d0481dc35f5fcc2e826d3759a60ea25ab399a90d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nわ、わかりました……私、選んでみます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n好、好的……我来选选看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "20d7f86d4c053145d0d421d7569dea7647950053db7d860e4aba10b5af5b8284", "ja": "たしか、衣装に似た瓶の香水があったような……。\nでも香りが強かったかも……。それなら……ふふっ♪", "zh": "我记得好像有一瓶香水，瓶子和这套服装很像……  \n不过香味可能有点浓……那样的话……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0324_1023_p", "source_sha256": "29718b21acca697f2a0af8436549c4f799d671f9d52559dee99bd3a9913e4d81", "ja": "（可憐は衣装をみながら、楽しそうに悩んでいる。\nこの香りや衣装が、可憐の自信に繋がるといいな……）", "zh": "（可怜一边看着服装，一边开心地烦恼着。希望这个香味和这套服装，能成为可怜自信的源泉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
